{"id":"ae2aea0052d422dc","group":"92","path":"92/92-fact-delta0-decidable.md","title":"fact-delta0-decidable — Delta 0 Sentences Decidable","display":"fact-delta0-decidable — Delta_0 Sentences Decidable","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-fact-delta0-decidable","aliases":["92-fact-delta0-decidable"],"display":"fact-delta0-decidable — Delta_0 Sentences Decidable","depends_on":["[[92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]","[[92-df-bounded-quantifier]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-standard-model]]","[[92-df-axiom-set]]","[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-arithmetic-truth]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-fact-delta0-decidable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-fact-delta0-decidable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-delta0-decidable — Delta_0 Sentences Decidable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7ce1b12990ae9469\" href=\"?note=7ce1b12990ae9469\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy\">92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6ed78135d2cc20c6\" href=\"?note=6ed78135d2cc20c6\" title=\"92-df-bounded-quantifier\">92-df-bounded-quantifier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ccb738ae4bbf923c\" href=\"?note=ccb738ae4bbf923c\" title=\"92-df-standard-model\">92-df-standard-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"35c764f4e9f21f28\" href=\"?note=35c764f4e9f21f28\" title=\"92-df-axiom-set\">92-df-axiom-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" href=\"?note=482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-truth\">92-df-arithmetic-truth</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\in \\Delta_0^G\">\\(\\varphi \\in \\Delta_0^G\\)</span> (bounded formula, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"7ce1b12990ae9469\" href=\"?note=7ce1b12990ae9469\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy\">92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentence)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> (Robinson-arithmetic axiom set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span> (axiom set of system <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"35c764f4e9f21f28\" href=\"?note=35c764f4e9f21f28\" title=\"92-df-axiom-set\">92-df-axiom-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N_G\">\\(\\mathfrak N_G\\)</span> (standard model, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"ccb738ae4bbf923c\" href=\"?note=ccb738ae4bbf923c\" title=\"92-df-standard-model\">92-df-standard-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G\\)</span> (standard arithmetic truth, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" href=\"?note=482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-truth\">92-df-arithmetic-truth</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}delta0\\text{-}decidable}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Delta_0^G\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\Bigl[(\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\varphi)\\Longrightarrow G\\vdash\\varphi)\n\\land(\\neg\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\varphi)\\Longrightarrow G\\vdash\\neg\\varphi)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}delta0\\text{-}decidable}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Delta_0^G\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\Bigl[(\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\varphi)\\Longrightarrow G\\vdash\\varphi)\n\\land(\\neg\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\varphi)\\Longrightarrow G\\vdash\\neg\\varphi)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span>句子：只使用有界量词</li>\n<li>有界量词可实际计算</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x &lt; t\">\\(\\forall x &lt; t\\)</span>：检查<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>从<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>到<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span>的值</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x &lt; t\">\\(\\exists x &lt; t\\)</span>：搜索<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>从<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>到<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span></li>\n<li>所有计算都是有限且原始递归的</li>\n<li>公理集包含<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>的算术系统能证明每个真闭<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span>句，并反驳每个假闭<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span>句；不能把公理集<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>与形式系统三元组<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>直接写成<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq G\">\\(Q\\subseteq G\\)</span></li>\n<li>这是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>完备性的基础</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"7ce1b12990ae9469","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-bounded-quantifier","status":"resolved","id":"6ed78135d2cc20c6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-bounded-quantifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"468d35690d25ee42","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-standard-model","status":"resolved","id":"ccb738ae4bbf923c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-standard-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-axiom-set","status":"resolved","id":"35c764f4e9f21f28","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-axiom-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-arithmetic-truth","status":"resolved","id":"482ac6c3f68b4b5b","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetic-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"7ce1b12990ae9469","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\va